SUMMARY:Artisan Village Vendor Demonstrations
DESCRIPTION:Thursday\, December 3\, 10 am  2 pm: Demo with Miranda Fasnacht Fiber Art. Watch Miranda hand-spin Angora fiber on her antique spinning wheels and meet the rabbits she raises. \nFriday\, December 4\, 11 am – 1 pm: Meet artist Judy Lemezis from Makery Park and watch this small-batch potter make her Christmas stars. \nFriday\, December 4\, 2 pm – 5 pm: Meet artist Michelle Piccione and watch her create and paint colorful hex signs.. \nSaturday\, December 5\, 11 am – 1 pm: Watch how artist Sheryl Allston lights her lotion candles and then sample the lotion made with soy wax and shea butter. \nMonday\, December 7\, 11 am – 1 pm: Sample Betsy Lantz’s mustard with Hammond’s hand-rolled sourdough pretzels. \nTuesday\, December 8\, 10 am – 2 pm: Join artist Suzan Noll of Suzie’s Creations as she creates shadowboxes and ornaments made from paper cut with a Cricut. \nTuesday\, December 8\, 2 pm – 5 pm:  Watch artist Melissa Andrews sew her rag bowls from upcycled fabrics in festive colors. \nWednesday\, December 9\, 10 am – 2 pm: Sample local honey from YellowSeventeen. \nThursday\, December 10\, 10 am – 2 pm:  Meet Melissa\, the tour organizer and author of Lancaster County based mysteries. Receive extra shopping spree entry forms\, chat about the tour\, and purchase signed copies of her newest release\, Banking on the Truth. \nFriday\, December 11\, 10 am – 2 pm: Sample locally made\, all natural granola from Grandview Granola. \n  \n 
URL:https://bird-in-hand.com/event/artisan-village-vendor-demonstrations/
LOCATION:Bird-in-Hand Artisan Village\, 2705 Old Philadelphia Pike\, Bird-in-Hand\, PA\, 17505\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bird-in-hand.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ARtistDemosHeader.jpg
END:VEVENT
